{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21682","headline":"和乐天过秘阁书省旧厅 · 元稹","name":"和乐天过秘阁书省旧厅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻君西省重徘徊，秘阁书房次第开。\n壁记欲题三漏合，吏人惊问十年来。\n经排蠹简怜初校，芸长陈根识旧栽。\n司马见诗心最苦，满身蚊蚋哭烟埃。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21682.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21682","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}